      "content": "wait, if vitamin K counteracts it, wouldn't i just need to take a slightly higher dose of my warfarin to balance it out? like if i know i'm eating a lot of greens, can i just adjust my dose myself so i don't have to worry about the clotting risk? it seems easier than trying to avoid all the good stuff.",
